    "Due to regulatory constraints, we need to verify that you are not in the UK.  We only check your location when you enter the Coinbase features." : {
      "comment" : "Geoblock",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Due to regulatory constraints, we need to verify that you are not in the UK.  We only check your location when you enter the Coinbase features."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
