            "value" : "Resets local wallet data for every network. Your wallet keys stay on this device, and a full rescan restores your funds and transaction history. Custom wallet names and manually tracked masternodes and their labels must be recreated; a recovery phrase backup does not preserve them. The rescan can take a while."
          }
