    "Your device time is %@ by %lld seconds. You cannot use CoinJoin due to this difference.\n\nThe time settings on your device needs to be changed to “Set time automatically” to use CoinJoin." : {
      "comment" : "TimeSkew",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
